  "limitations": [
    "Explicit association only: one verified selected face per independent owner, complete available membership, no automatic classification or inferred cross-person identity.",
    "Existing v1 canonical scalar persistence intentionally has no durable named-style badge. Generic later changes are reviewed from full managed-key coverage without guessing a recipe name.",
    "Canonical no-op remains a known preflight no-write refusal, including changing names at zero. Face overrides retain precedence; zero neutralizes shared managed leaves, not prior face values.",
    "Single-photo shared-source alias admission remains separate. Existing unsupported anatomy and alpha/HDR derived pipelines remain fenced; no clipping or reconstruction.",
    "Named preflight requires existing reviewed scopes. Generic lifecycle preflight keeps existing guarded routing; no claim of universal cache immutability.",
    "Dual collarbone and portrait proofs share real image bytes but require both exact ACK families. Images are RGB8 1024-edge review reductions, not full-resolution precision acceptance.",
    "All product execution/imports, tests/build/typecheck, inference/download, native/history/export/save-reopen/numerical/photographic/performance acceptance UNRUN. Authored fixtures mock source/render boundaries."
